# Spova platform (agent)

Source of truth: `docs/PLATFORM_PLAN.md` (PDF copy: `docs/PLATFORM_PLAN.pdf`).
Implementation spec: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.pdf` — routes, every REST endpoint, WS events, full schema (tables/columns/enums), core flows, risk engine, jobs, env vars, milestone acceptance (9/13/16 Oct). Read it before adding any route, table, or job.

We are cloning **product shape** of spova.com (marketing + client CRM + live trader + admin), **not** buying Fintech360/MatchTrader.

## Stack (locked)

- pnpm Turborepo, Next.js 15 + Tailwind + shadcn, NestJS + Prisma, PostgreSQL, Redis, BullMQ, R2 for KYC
- Charts: TradingView Lightweight Charts
- Auth: JWT httpOnly cookies
- Money: `NUMERIC(18,2)` + `LEDGER_ENTRY` in the same transaction as balance change. No Mongo/Firebase for ledger.

## Four apps, one API

Marketing `/`, client `/app`, trader `/trade`, admin `/admin`.

## Order of work

Phase 0 skeleton → Phase 1 **ledger + admin credit/debit/freeze** → Phase 2 KYC + payment requests → Phase 3 demo trader WS → Phase 4 marketing pages → Phase 5 live + one PSP.

Do not start K8s, matching engine, Praxis, or InvestiQ before Phase 1 is demoable.

## Trading v1

CFD on our books. Margin call 100%, stop-out 20%, configurable. Demo vs live = `trading_account.type`.

When adding tables or endpoints, match the ERD in `docs/PLATFORM_PLAN.md`.

## Current state (Phase 0-1 done, 5 Oct)

- Pinned: Next 15.5, Nest 11, Prisma 6.19, TS 5.9, Tailwind 4, zod 3. Do not bump majors without asking.
- Run: `pnpm db:up` (Postgres+Redis via podman/docker compose) → `pnpm --filter @spova/shared build` → `pnpm --filter @spova/api prisma:deploy && pnpm db:seed` → `pnpm dev`. Web :3000, API :4000. `apps/api/.env` is a symlink to root `.env` (Prisma CLI needs it).
- Seeds: `admin@zerventa.local / Admin@12345` (superadmin), `client@zerventa.local / Client@12345` (demo login 100001). Brand/domain placeholder `XYZ` lives only in `.env`.
- Money path: only `LedgerService.postInTx` touches `trading_accounts.balance/credit`. `ledger_entries` and `admin_audit` have DB triggers rejecting UPDATE/DELETE.
- WS: API gateway relays `{room,event,payload}` from Redis channel `ws:events`; worker publishes to the same channel. Rooms `user:{id}`, `account:{id}`, `symbol:{S}`, `admin`.
- Shared DTO/zod live in `packages/shared` (built to `dist/`; rebuild after edits).
- Phase 2 done (8 Oct): KYC documents (`modules/kyc`, upload through the API into `StorageService` - local disk in dev, R2/S3 via `STORAGE_DRIVER=s3`; admin approve/reject recomputes `users.kyc_*` from approved docs), payment request queue (`modules/payments`; approve posts through `LedgerService.postInTx` with `ref_type=payment_request`, withdrawals re-checked at approval, no hold), support tickets (`modules/support`), newsletter (`modules/newsletter`). Client UI under `/app/documents|payments|help`, admin under `/admin/kyc|payments|tickets`.
- Tests: `pnpm --filter @spova/api test:e2e` runs `apps/api/test/phase2.e2e.ts` against a running API (creates throw-away users; clears dev rate-limit keys first). CI runs it after seeding.
- Public site: all spova.com pages exist (markets, 5 tier pages, CFD list, swap fees, market holidays, CFD expiries, education set, company/legal set). Light "white + trust blue" theme is token-driven in `apps/web/src/app/globals.css`; audience is Indian retail, keep it simple and bright.
- Phase 3 done (9 Oct): contract in `docs/PHASE3_CONTRACT.md`. Pure risk math in `packages/shared/src/risk.ts` (used by api, worker, web). `apps/worker` = Binance bookTicker (crypto) + synthetic random walk (FX/metals/indices/stocks, session-aware) -> `price:{S}` (our price incl. markup) + `tick`/`candle` WS events, candle aggregation into `candles` (backfill on boot), risk loop (floating P/L, SL/TP, pending triggers, margin call, stop-out) that only *asks* the API via `/v1/internal/trading/*` (header `X-Internal-Token`). `apps/api/modules/trading` is the only writer of orders/positions; closes/fills go through `LedgerService.postInTx` with the account row locked; stop-out clamps balance at 0 (ledger `adjustment`); nightly swap posts ledger `swap`. Terminal at `/trade`, admin book at `/admin/trades`.
- Run everything: `./scripts/up.sh` (db, migrate, seed, api :4000, web :3000, worker). Dev: `pnpm dev` + `pnpm --filter @spova/worker dev`.
- Tests: `pnpm --filter @spova/api test:e2e` (phase2 + phase3 suites, API must be running; phase3 seeds a BTCUSD quote when the worker is off), `pnpm --filter @spova/worker test` (unit). CI runs both.
- Next: statement PDF, public contact form -> ticket, admin risk-config/symbol admin pages, live PSP (Phase 5).
